  <diagram id="LdB5_cXPZaA9HB-LTF3I" name="Rules">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2044" dy="2314" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="MF1m_ZkBR2TVqJmVzc5--1" value="&lt;h1&gt;Rules&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Every process has a start point and an end point which are not other BPs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Two BPs may not have the same start and end point: this would mean they are the same BP but with multiple routes inside&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- No Step/Box without an APN number: remove the interface boxes that are not needed (i.e AME, AMS, eTL...)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- One APN per box (more may be possible if the same action can be done in multiple APNs)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Other BPs have to be detailed using their number and name&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Each Decision Point can be associated with a description if adds value&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- No Swim lanes for departments, they should be identified by colour coding with a legend at the bottom - No other colour coding is allowed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Interfaces &quot;in&quot; and &quot;out&quot; data flow shall be represented with arrows point towards the &quot;cloud&quot; or towards the action.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- The BP needs to fit on an A4 or A3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="190" y="-780" width="510" height="597" as="geometry" />
